# Development environments
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Claude Code session worktrees and local settings. A session creates its worktree in the
# current directory, so sometimes inside this one, and each is a full copy of the repository.
# Until this folder became a repository of its own the rule lived in the monorepo's .gitignore,
# a file this repository does not carry.
.claude/

# System
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Test evidence. Kept on disk for whoever holds this mod, never in git: screenshots and
# Player.log copies grow without limit. Tests/RESULTS.md is the short summary that stays
# versioned. See STATUS.md, "Evidence retention".
Tests/Pickle/Evidence/
evidence/

# Uncompressed textures. This mod ships PNG only; a .dds here would mean a texture
# imported without conversion, never something to distribute or track.
*.dds

# Step assembly intermediates, outside the test mod folder.
.build/
